legal-site/privacy.html:66: <h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
legal-site/privacy.html:67: <ul>
legal-site/privacy.html:68:   <li><strong>Voice recordings:</strong> deleted from our backend as soon as processing finishes &mdash; normally within seconds of you speaking. We do not keep an archive of your recordings.</li>
legal-site/privacy.html:69:   <li><strong>Reminder text and generated audio:</strong> kept until you delete the reminder. Deleting a reminder in the app deletes its stored text and its audio files from our backend as well.</li>
legal-site/privacy.html:70:   <li><strong>Reminders on your device:</strong> stored locally so the app works offline, and removed when you delete the reminder or uninstall the app.</li>
legal-site/privacy.html:71:   <li><strong>Crash reports:</strong> retained by our error-monitoring service for a limited period (typically up to 90 days) and then discarded.</li>
legal-site/privacy.html:72:   <li><strong>Subscription records:</strong> kept by our subscription-management service and by Apple for as long as needed for billing and tax purposes.</li>
